    <summary>A free, self-contained disk space analyser for Windows with exact and near-duplicate detection, search, batch rename, and snapshot comparison.</summary>
    <description>
DiskGeek scans your drives and shows exactly what's eating your space:

- List view and treemap view of disk usage
- Exact and perceptual-hash (near-duplicate) file detection
- Similar-image finding
- Full-text search across scan results
- Batch rename
- Snapshot comparison, to see what changed over time
- Scheduled scans

No installer bloat, no bundled offers, no telemetry. 100% free, no Pro tier.

**Note:** the installer is not yet signed with a paid code-signing certificate, so Windows SmartScreen may show an "unrecognised app" warning the first time you run it — this is disclosed on the product's own page and is expected for a small independent publisher. See tools\VERIFICATION.txt in this package for how to independently verify the installer checksum.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://techygeekshome.info/diskgeek/ — 1.0.0.0: initial public release.</releaseNotes>
